---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const updated = 'August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How MCA Heart collects, uses and protects the information you share with us.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell shell--narrow legal">
      <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="legal__note">
        <strong>Template notice.</strong> This page is a working draft written for
        the site rebuild. Have it reviewed by counsel before publishing, and
        confirm it reflects your actual data practices.
      </div>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the enquiry form we collect the name, email address and any
        phone number, location, designation and message you choose to provide. We
        collect this only because you sent it to us.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your details to reply to your enquiry and, where relevant, to discuss
        research or collaboration opportunities with the MCA Heart Research Lab. We do
        not sell your information, and we do not add you to marketing lists without
        asking first.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Video content is embedded from YouTube. Nothing loads from YouTube until you
        press play on a video; once you do, YouTube may set cookies and process data
        under its own privacy policy. Enquiry emails are delivered through our email
        provider.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry correspondence is retained for as long as needed to handle your
        request and to maintain a record of collaboration discussions.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what information we hold about you, request corrections, or
        ask us to delete it. Contact us through the
        <a class="link-underline" href="/contact">enquiry form</a> and we will respond.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal { color: var(--text); }
  .legal__meta {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .legal__note {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    padding: var(--space-s);
    background: var(--accent-wash);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }
  .legal p { margin-top: var(--space-s); line-height: 1.75; }
  .legal a { color: var(--blue); }
</style>
